                "loc": "DEU.27.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 27.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja nami haad'afi ilme wolti fuud'e, nami sunini ya waan daba tahe. Worra sadeenu ha gubanu ijeesani, aka dabi akasi sunini deebie isani keesa inteenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
