            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seera kiyyafi aada tiyya ch'ufa jabeesa guuta, aka lafti Kanaani ta anini iti isani geesu, isani diddeufira isani ingussine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aada gosa anini lafa suni keesa isani duraa gussu gula yaatani keesati infidamina. Waan worri waan hamtu akana kana ch'ufa taheefi anini worra jibbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini, lafa aananifi dammi aka lolaa yau tana fud'ad'a, d'aala isaniini jed'e. Anini AABBO Waaqa keesani, ka gosa ch'ufa keesaa koba isani baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi isani bineensafi simpirre qulqulloofi ta qulqullo intahini, aka dansa gargari baasu maltani. Bineensafi simpirre qulqullo intahini inyaatina. Anini, wonti sunini qulqullooniti ya jed'e, tanaafi yo nyaattani qulqullooma d'abdani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani qulqullooftani nama kiyya tahu maltani, wonti akanatiifi anini AABBO Waaqa qulqullo. Ammalle anini gosa d'ibi keesaa koba isani baase, aka isani nama kiyya taatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
